Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add `view.setBackgroundBlur` (#51076)

* feat: blur views

* spec: add tests, limit values to positive

* docs: be explicit in units for blurRadius

Co-authored-by: Erick Zhao <erick@hotmail.ca>

* lint: trailing space

